+// Regenerates feature/unicode-id.js: the code points above ASCII of
+// ECMAScript's IdentifierName (§12.7), from the running Node's Unicode data.
+// Tables, not \p{…}: a parser compiled by a compiler without Unicode property
+// tables (jz compiles subscript into its own compiler) still reads them.
+//   START: ID_Start.  PART: ID_Continue less ID_Start, with ZWNJ and ZWJ.
+// Each is a sorted list of range boundaries [first, last + 1, …], every value
+// the distance from the one before.
